flowchart LR
 C[Client] --> G[Gateway and authentication]
 G --> V[Token and request validation]
 V --> A[Bounded admission queue]
 A --> T[Tokenizer]
 T --> S[Inference scheduler]
 S --> P[Prefill]
 P --> K[(KV cache blocks)]
 K --> D[Continuous decode batch]
 D --> W[Streaming response]
 D --> M[Metrics and traces]
 W --> C
 X[Cancellation and deadline] --> A
 X --> S
 S --> R[Release cache and slots]
